    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:1em; border:1px solid #999; font-size:90%; text-align:center; background:#363636\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i>This article details the Mask of Darth Nihilus Sith Artifact found in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a>. You may be looking for <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> Adventure Module of the same name, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mask_of_Darth_Nihilus\" title=\"The Mask of Darth Nihilus\">The Mask of Darth Nihilus</a>.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i> </p><p>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sith_Artifact\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sith Artifact\">Sith Artifact</a> encourages the wearer to slowly destroy him- or herself for greater power. Anyone who does not possess Force-related <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> gains <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Training\" title=\"Force Training\">Force Training</a> while wearing the mask. A Jedi or Sith wearing the mask gains two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Training\" title=\"Force Training\">Force Training</a> Feats. At least half of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> gained in this manner must have the [<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side\">Dark Side</a></i>] descriptor. </p><p>The mask extracts a heavy toll from it's wearer. Each time the wearer uses a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> or spends a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>, he or she gains a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side Point\">Dark Side Point</a>. Each time the wearer uses a number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> equal to his or her <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> modifier in a single encounter, the wearer moves -1 step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> and gains a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a>. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> is removed only when the wearer takes off the mask. </p>",
